# Supabase CLI scratch state, written by `supabase link`.
#
# Machine-local and worth keeping out of the repo on principle: it records which
# project this checkout is pointed at, and `pooler-url` holds a database
# connection string. The CLI does not put the password in it — the one here is
# username and host only — but a file whose shape is "connection string" is a
# bad thing to have tracked in a public repository, because the day it does
# contain a password is the day nobody re-reads it.
.temp/
.branches/
